            },
            "description": "POST, not PUT: each scan stamps its own timestamp, so it is not idempotent.\n\nEVERY attempt is written to p2p_spi_scan_logs, success and failure alike. A rejected scan never touches the put-away row, so without that log it would be invisible."
          }
